h2 { "Release scope" }

There are no numerical or cancellation-contract changes in this release. Cross-compilation supports the CPU backend, not Metal kernel compilation or cross-target sanitizers. macOS x86-64, 32-bit targets, CUDA, Vulkan and FreeBSD distribution qualification are not included. Existing macOS Metal requirements remain Xcode 26.2 and the pinned Metal Toolchain component.

